'''Gravi''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] added in [[Version 9.10 Update|Version 9.10]]. It can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Nature's Guardians ELEMENTAL PIXIES (Gacha Event)|Nature's Guardians ELEMENTAL PIXIES]] event. Its [[True Form]] introduced in [[Version 10.6 Update|Version 10.6]] gives it more attack power and health, as well as increasing its [[Wave Attack]] level. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 13.7 Update|Version 13.7]].

